        "text": "I created four different adapter designs before I found the perfect fit for the splines. I made the first three adapters to try to fit the motor to a 90-degree gearbox and have the motor transversely mounted, but I could never get the gears to mesh correctly. I then switched to having the motor mounted inline with the driveshaft, which worked much better."
