        "text": "As a small side note, I ordered the final adapter just as tariffs on Chinese goods hit, which forced me to change manufacturers. The quality of the final product was not as good as I hoped. The tolerances on the motor spline were slightly off, which led to 1.5 hours of hand-filing to get the right fit."
