        "type": "p",
        "text": "This project came with some of my biggest setbacks, except for the bike that caught fire. It took almost a year and a half from start to finish due to everything from laziness to tariffs. It really pushed my limits of designing for manufacturing and my engineering knowledge in general. I failed many times with the gearbox and my spline adapters, but I always made another version."
