        "text": "Seeing how happy my mom was with the final product made it worth all the trouble. The final ATV was quiet enough to have a normal conversation while riding and fast enough to pull a wheelie when necessary. It could go through foot-deep mud and up rutted hills without complaint. While this project did have many of my biggest failures, it was nevertheless an incredible success."
